{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q28.material.recovered", "text": "材料：下面是某教师在《雅典的民主政治》一课中的课堂活动。活动主题：评选“三好改革家”。活动过程：在梭伦、克利斯提尼、伯利克里三位候选人中评选出一名“三好改革家”。教师发给学生有关梭伦改革、克利斯提尼改革、伯利克里改革的三组材料。学生分A、B、C、D四组，其中A组为评委组。另外B、C、D三组每组发一个改革家的材料。然后B、C、D三组根据教师所发材料和教科书的内容进行讨论和评选。B、C、D三组各由一名代表陈述推选的理由，并与其他两组进行辩论。最后，由评委组宣布评选结果及理由。活动评价：活动结束后，教师对各组的参与态度进行点评。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bf1746268ee76887a98c6d2e768232440bb0d2e53491297ceb085599e3745b3f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3270, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3534, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bf1746268ee76887a98c6d2e768232440bb0d2e53491297ceb085599e3745b3f"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s1.k10", "ntce.gaozhong.lishi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.410.r001", "ntce.outline.410.r009"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.lishi.2017a-k2.q28"], "word_count": 264, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bf1746268ee76887a98c6d2e768232440bb0d2e53491297ceb085599e3745b3f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3270, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3534, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2017年上半年教师资格证考试《高中历史》题.csv", "role